WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
You look very sleepy like this, okay?

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,400
Why do you smell so good?

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,400
In our Shazhou City

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,200
The fragrance on your body means that this person is choking

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,400
Not a good word for a nervous general.

6
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,600
How come I smell so good?

7
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,000
I've been doing physical work for a day

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,400
It must have a bit of a smell, right?

9
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,400
It's the aroma

10
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,400
It smells really good

11
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,200
Is it this fragrance? What is this?

12
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:22,380
This stuff smells great. Where can I buy it? Can it be opened? What is this?

13
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,380
This is called Harmony Balm

14
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:24,980
It's what we use to wipe the body over there.

15
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,580
Keep skin from being too dry

16
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,980
In addition to moisturizing and whitening the skin

17
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,380
This medicine can be used to relieve symptoms and relieve symptoms

18
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,780
Fierce and depressing

19
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,780
Isn’t this what your girlfriend gave you?

20
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,180
I quite like this thing

21
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,380
Give me this

22
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,180
If Mr. Lu likes it, just take it.

23
00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,380
I can't let you suffer either

24
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:42,180
I’ll give you a little more salary today, no need to be like this

25
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,580
Then didn’t I sell this thing?

26
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,580
You can sell it to others

27
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:45,980
But it’s not okay to sell it to Mr. Lu

28
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:47,180
Mr. Lu asked me to stay here for one day

29
00:00:47,180 --> 00:00:48,580
You gave me five hundred yuan to take care of me.

30
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,580
But I, Lu Shuang, don’t like to take advantage of others.

31
00:00:50,580 --> 00:00:52,780
Since you don't like me buying it, then so be it.

32
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:53,780
I'll give you a salary increase of three hundred

33
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,780
I will give you three hundred yuan now to go to Mr. Lu.

34
00:00:55,780 --> 00:00:56,980
Don’t you want a salary increase?

35
00:00:56,980 --> 00:01:06,080
Take it

36
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,480
Why are you laughing?

37
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,080
This stuff does smell good.

38
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:11,080
And very special

39
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:12,880
I've never smelled this scent before
